  {
   "id": 32,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -480,
    64
   ],
   "size": [
    400,
    600
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 1,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Start here",
   "properties": {
    "ue_properties": {
     "widget_ue_connectable": {},
     "version": "7.8",
     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    },
    "text": "# Reshoot 4D\nReshoot any video in 4D.\n\n**How to run**\n1. Pick a video in **Capture** and trim it (2 to 8 s, one person).\n2. Queue. The capture builds, then the Virtual Camera stops the run: it has no move yet.\n3. Click **Open Virtual Camera**, direct your move, close it.\n4. Queue again. Retake, then Photoreal Pass.\n\nThe same video and trim reuse the capture, so step 4 only re-runs what changed.\n\nSee docs/INSTALL.md for documented hardware and docs/WORKFLOW.md for stage settings.\n\n**This example** is set up on the railing video with a gentle arc and rise.\n\nDocs: README, docs/WORKFLOW.md, docs/EDITOR.md"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Reshoot 4D\nReshoot any video in 4D.\n\n**How to run**\n1. Pick a video in **Capture** and trim it (2 to 8 s, one person).\n2. Queue. The capture builds, then the Virtual Camera stops the run: it has no move yet.\n3. Click **Open Virtual Camera**, direct your move, close it.\n4. Queue again. Retake, then Photoreal Pass.\n\nThe same video and trim reuse the capture, so step 4 only re-runs what changed.\n\nSee docs/INSTALL.md for documented hardware and docs/WORKFLOW.md for stage settings.\n\n**This example** is set up on the railing video with a gentle arc and rise.\n\nDocs: README, docs/WORKFLOW.md, docs/EDITOR.md"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Reshoot 4D\nReshoot any video in 4D.\n\n**How to run**\n1. Pick a video in **Capture** and trim it (2 to 8 s, one person).\n2. Queue. The capture builds, then the Virtual Camera stops the run: it has no move yet.\n3. Click **Open Virtual Camera**, direct your move, close it.\n4. Queue again. Retake, then Photoreal Pass.\n\nThe same video and trim reuse the capture, so step 4 only re-runs what changed.\n\nSee docs/INSTALL.md for documented hardware and docs/WORKFLOW.md for stage settings.\n\n**This example** is set up on the railing video with a gentle arc and rise.\n\nDocs: README, docs/WORKFLOW.md, docs/EDITOR.md"
