   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {
    "ue_properties": {
     "widget_ue_connectable": {},
     "version": "7.8",
     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    },
    "text": "## 1. Capture\nTurns a video into a 4D capture of the person's motion and setting, with an estimated source-camera path and scale.\n\n**mode**\n- **quick**: tracking, source-camera solve and setting preparation. The 4D camera editor shows a mannequin coloured from the video.\n- **4DGS splat**: adds generated views and a trained 4D Gaussian splat for the editor preview.\n- **mannequin only**: generated views, no training.\n\n**subject** picks who to capture when there is more than one person.\n\nThe previews below show the trimmed video, the generated views and the trained splat (splat modes only)."
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 1. Capture\nTurns a video into a 4D capture of the person's motion and setting, with an estimated source-camera path and scale.\n\n**mode**\n- **quick**: tracking, source-camera solve and setting preparation. The 4D camera editor shows a mannequin coloured from the video.\n- **4DGS splat**: adds generated views and a trained 4D Gaussian splat for the editor preview.\n- **mannequin only**: generated views, no training.\n\n**subject** picks who to capture when there is more than one person.\n\nThe previews below show the trimmed video, the generated views and the trained splat (splat modes only)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
