   "properties": {
    "ue_properties": {
     "widget_ue_connectable": {},
     "version": "7.8",
     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    },
    "text": "## 3. Retake\nReDirector reshoots the source video along your camera path.\n\n- Runs in its own Python env (see docs/REDIRECTOR.md), shows live progress and can be cancelled.\n- **prompt** empty = Qwen3-VL writes it from the first frame.\n- Start with 480p and 50 steps; higher resolution increases rendering time."
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3. Retake\nReDirector reshoots the source video along your camera path.\n\n- Runs in its own Python env (see docs/REDIRECTOR.md), shows live progress and can be cancelled.\n- **prompt** empty = Qwen3-VL writes it from the first frame.\n- Start with 480p and 50 steps; higher resolution increases rendering time."
