  {
   "id": 36,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    2074,
    64
   ],
   "size": [
    440,
    300
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 5,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {
    "ue_properties": {
     "widget_ue_connectable": {},
     "version": "7.8",
     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    },
    "text": "## 4. Photoreal Pass\nLTX 2.3 renders every final frame. Portrait output is 1024x1792; landscape output is 1792x1024.\n\n- **crossview** (default): Cseti's CrossView-Warp IC-LoRA. A depth warp of the real video along your path and the real video itself guide LTX.\n- Starts from the retake at **crossview_start 0.7**. Two stages, with the detailer LoRA in the last one.\n- **union control** keeps the earlier pass: the retake's Canny edges and the real first frame as guides (start_strength 0.35).\n\nThe final shot saves to output/reshoot4d/."
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 4. Photoreal Pass\nLTX 2.3 renders every final frame. Portrait output is 1024x1792; landscape output is 1792x1024.\n\n- **crossview** (default): Cseti's CrossView-Warp IC-LoRA. A depth warp of the real video along your path and the real video itself guide LTX.\n- Starts from the retake at **crossview_start 0.7**. Two stages, with the detailer LoRA in the last one.\n- **union control** keeps the earlier pass: the retake's Canny edges and the real first frame as guides (start_strength 0.35).\n\nThe final shot saves to output/reshoot4d/."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
